{
  "about": "B1g (20 Nov 2026): the staging probe orders «بدي كرتونة مي تنورين، ربطة خبز الفورنو وقهوة نجار، عبعقلين» every hour. On 19 Nov (AK-1074 to AK-1076) the Al Forno pita AK-0080 reached the card; on 20 Nov at 07:17 the reply said «ربطة خبز الفورنو ما عنّا» (the card AK-1077 still carried the bread), at 08:19 code said «لسّا ما عنّا ربطة خبز الفورنو» and AK-1078 went without it, and from 09:22 the probe was offered three other breads and took Wooden Bakery (AK-1079 to AK-1088). The words never changed, nor did the data (since 16 Nov). Cause, read from staging (agent_runs, order_items, language_pack; plan_order_core rerun read-only on the probe's own reading): (1) data: the search-words job (auto-2026-11-16) wrote the brand Al Forno's one-word Arabic and Latin spellings («الفورنو», «فورنو», forno) on the piston bread AK-0083 only; on the pita AK-0080 it wrote «آل فورنو» / «ال فورنو» (two words, from its approved Arabic name). The same split exists across 45 brands (Yamama: «اليماما» on the vinegar only; Tanmia: «التانمية» on one mortadella only). (2) logic: with «الفورنو» unexplained by the breads that fit «خبز», CX2's guard (0256/0257, b4 other_kind) read it as another product's brand and turned the line into 'not carried', though that brand's breads were sellable. The reading itself varies (query «خبز الفورنو» or «خبز»): with «خبز» the planner offered three non-Al Forno breads; with «خبز الفورنو» it said not carried; the model's tool loop sometimes found AK-0080 by another search (19 Nov) and sometimes wrote 'we don't have it' while adding it (20 Nov 07:17). So the 19th 'found' was the model rescuing the planner, the 20th 'not carried' was the planner. Rule (B1g): never say we don't carry it when an item matching the brand or the type is sellable; ask which one instead. Run by test/db/b1g-brand-and-type.test.ts (staging's names and words written through save_search_words, the job's own door).",
  "run": "staging, probe turns 19 Nov 13:02, 15:04, 17:07 (found, path ask) and 20 Nov 07:17 (ask, «ما عنّا»), 08:19 (ask_pin, «لسّا ما عنّا»), 09:22 (which, three other breads); orders AK-1074 to AK-1088",
